  "title": "Champion Sled Dogs",
  "contentHtml": "<div class=\"post-content\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t<time datetime=\"2012-02-06\" class=\"post-date entry-date updated\">February 6, 2012</time>\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h1 class=\"post-title entry-title\"><a href=\"/champion-sled-dogs\">Champion Sled Dogs</a></h1>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"post-meta entry-meta\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"post-author\"><span class=\"author vcard\"><a class=\"url fn n\" href=\"/author/kathy\" rel=\"author\">kathy</a></span></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"post-category\"><a href=\"/category/main\" rel=\"category tag\">main</a></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-content\">\n\n        \t\t\t\t<!--themify_builder_content-->\n<div id=\"themify_builder_content-318\" data-postid=\"318\" class=\"themify_builder_content themify_builder_content-318 themify_builder tf_clear\">\n    \t<!-- module_row -->\n\t<div data-lazy=\"1\" class=\"module_row themify_builder_row tb_uq8x54 tb_first tf_clearfix\">\n\t    \t\t<div class=\"row_inner col_align_top col-count-1 tf_box tf_w tf_rel\">\n\t\t\t<div data-lazy=\"1\" class=\"module_column tb-column col-full first tb_19vf54 tf_box\">\n\t\t\t    \t        <div class=\"tb-column-inner tf_box tf_w\">\n\t\t    <!-- module text -->\n<div class=\"module module-text tb_widp565   \" data-lazy=\"1\">\n        <div class=\"tb_text_wrap\">\n    <p style=\"text-align: left;\">1988.03-Courtesy of Fbks Daily News-Miner of George run of ONAC&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; George At<img class=\"size-medium wp-image-1908 alignleft attla-content-img\" src=\"/images/attla/2012/02/george1988.jpg\" alt=\"\">tla says there is no way to make champions out of dogs without loving them and taking the best possible care of them. He’s convinced that sled dogs get more satisfaction out of running than any dog that’s a pet in people’s homes. Like humans, dogs that don’t love what they are doing, can’t give their best. A lot of communication takes place between a team of dogs and a driver that the public watching does not understand.&nbsp; George shares stories about some amazing races where the dogs did the thinking to win.</p>    </div>\n</div>\n<!-- /module text --><!-- module video -->\n<div class=\"module module-video tb_1ovm708 video-overlay  \" data-lazy=\"1\" data-url=\"https://youtu.be/LEEzu-21WPY\">\n    \t\t\t\t<div class=\"video-wrap-outer\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"video-wrap tf_rel tf_overflow\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<!-- /video-wrap -->\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<!-- /video-wrap-outer -->\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t        </div>\n\t    \t</div>\n\t\t    </div>\n\t    <!-- /row_inner -->\n\t</div>\n\t<!-- /module_row -->\n\t</div>\n<!--/themify_builder_content-->\n\t    \n\t</div><!-- /.entry-content -->\n\t\n\t</div>\n\t<!-- /.post-content -->"
